    "actual_behavior": "subprocess text decoding uses the GBK locale and raises UnicodeDecodeError when R emits UTF-8 output.",
    "additional_notes": null,
    "evidence": [
      "UnicodeDecodeError: 'gbk' codec cannot decode byte 0x80"
